  "title": "Air Fryer Pretzel Bites",
  "description": "These pretzel bites are made with two-ingredient dough and cooked in the air fryer. The make a tasty appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-06-07T16:21:57-04:00",
