  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups self-rising flour",
    "1 cup full-fat Greek yogurt",
    "4 cups water",
    "1 tablespoon baking soda",
    "cooking spray",
    "1 tablespoon coarse kosher salt, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6zsKB5qJhWW9kqo3umt2rRMdWnI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8400266-air-fryer-pretzel-bites-ddmfs-01-10997-74e4532272034743bf58819753ea5cca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8400266/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix self-rising flour and Greek yogurt together in a bowl until well combined. Turn out dough onto a floured surface and knead dough comes together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XtOLIDL4zPhhfKVfKtvhfxpSFZo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8400266-air-fryer-pretzel-bites-ddmfs-02-11005-2336d0235c5e488e94939c7684e9091b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8400266/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough into 3/4-inch thick ropes. Cut each rope into three 5-inch pieces and roll each piece into a small ball.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/F6-SwC2gPFV7uRAZ5QT6_ijmdA0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8400266-air-fryer-pretzel-bites-ddmfs-03-11006-c6809fcf27014c27bec66e2548dca8af.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8400266/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat an air fryer to 390 degrees F (200 degrees C) for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, bring water in a large pot to a boil over medium-high heat. Add baking soda to the boiling water. Carefully drop dough balls into the water and cook until they float to the top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/40T_7iThETX1_J1B8hGMrPpbs_8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8400266-air-fryer-pretzel-bites-ddmfs-05-11010-4d8571da826941de97f94ec0d0cbced2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8400266/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a slotted spoon remove dough balls once they float to the top and transfer to the air fryer basket in one line. You might need to cook them in batches.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aGVYmqc7sq-t7vQpWXpCpjraCOM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8400266-air-fryer-pretzel-bites-ddmfs-06-11012-bf761fe864c64eb3867390c40efd7925.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8400266/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook until pretzel bites are lightly browned, 8 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EwWkgsoRXTOObn-05-i45IAhKYc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8400266-air-fryer-pretzel-bites-ddmfs-07-11017-9f8046acec7c4754ab18b04c1ba34f42.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8400266/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spray pretzel bites with nonstick cooking spray and sprinkle kosher salt on top. Serve and enjoy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0M7Qon2Wa9xCNdfMWxnAsfOGrGA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8400266-air-fryer-pretzel-bites-ddmfs-08-11019-adccedce2c0444fb927272f0bd7c0e48.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8400266/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
